{"c":[{"name":"20261005T120623Z-4f068d6de508aa09","text":"B30: drafted goal text is checked in goals/drafts.ts as whole typed facts; every digit must land in a fact, and a from value ref stands for its source window or memory. Two reviews found recombination holes: add whole-expression rules, never token allowlists.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T155131Z-2d735fed11dec073","text":"R2: scripts that replay typing must send a typed value (snapshot values) in the same snapshot as its text: a value that arrives after the sentence boundary opens no breakpoint, so the event card is never listed.","type":"note"}]}
